[ext_resource type="Texture2D" path="res://assets/organized/ui/ui-derived-spell-icon-cinderbreath-fire.png" id="3_icon"]

; The Pyromancer opener, and the first sustained spell in the game.
;
; BaseDamage is damage PER TICK, not per cast - the flame ticks every 0.2s for 1.5s, so a full
; burn is roughly seven applications of it to everything standing in the cone. That is why the
; number looks small next to Fireball: it is paid out seven times per cycle, to a crowd.
;
; BaseCooldown is the recharge between burns, not the time between casts. BaseRange is how far the
; cone reaches, and it is deliberately short - a flamethrower that outranged a bolt would just be a
; better bolt. The trade is that it covers an arc but only at the distance where things can hit you.

